        {
          "id": 2864507147,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "[oops, was still pending from earlier]\n\nThe suggested function above (not in 'Changes') is mostly based upon the path.  In epan/dissectors, dissector filenames follow the convention well, whereas in plugins they do not.\n\nIf (as Michael suggested) I created a separate utilities module, would you be happy for this script to also use it?  I'd probably want to use 'that 'is_generated_file()' in your script to:\n- show that the file is generated so someone could know not to edit directly\n- not do the automatic replacement there",
